All-wheel drive 2 UAZ – a Russian automotive adventure through Russia's most remote and unpredictable regions. This time, each user will take a ride in a UAZ and test its capabilities on the most challenging terrain. You'll be driving through Novaya Zemlya with its frozen ice, Karelia, through its small mountain canyons, and don't miss the opportunity to drive through Siberia, which occupies most of Russia and is full of challenging roads. But given that the UAZ is a four-wheel drive vehicle, you'll be able to handle any obstacle; the key is to never stop. Customization, damage modeling, and many other nice touches are included.

Game features:
- no rules during the race, use a variety of ramming and cutting opportunities, the main goal is to win;
- the game has about 39 vehicles of various formats, including improved UAZs and original factory assemblies;
- an improved customization and tuning system that allows you to create an original car of a given model;
- the ability to use additional equipment for the most difficult routes: navigators, winches, etc.
- and most importantly, you can now download the UAZ 2-Wheel Drive via torrent from us at https://itorrents-igruha.org/.

